{"id":"df4da83945861d78","group":"28","path":"28/28-thm-qbf-k-complete.md","title":"QSAT-k is Sigma-k-P-Complete","display":"thm-qbf-k-complete — QSAT-k is Sigma-k-P-Complete","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-thm-qbf-k-complete","aliases":["28-thm-qbf-k-complete","QSAT-k Completeness"],"display":"thm-qbf-k-complete — QSAT-k is Sigma-k-P-Complete","depends_on":["[[28-df-qbf-k]]","[[28-df-sigma-k-p]]","[[28-df-poly-reduction]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-thm-qbf-k-complete"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-thm-qbf-k-complete</span><span>QSAT-k Completeness</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-qbf-k-complete — QSAT-k is Sigma-k-P-Complete"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"91bfe52ee99ebd32\" href=\"?note=91bfe52ee99ebd32\" title=\"28-df-qbf-k\">28-df-qbf-k</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e4f9f10bc85fd486\" href=\"?note=e4f9f10bc85fd486\" title=\"28-df-sigma-k-p\">28-df-sigma-k-p</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"14088421136f8182\" href=\"?note=14088421136f8182\" title=\"28-df-poly-reduction\">28-df-poly-reduction</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{QSAT}_k\">\\(\\mathrm{QSAT}_k\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_k^{\\mathbf P}\">\\(\\Sigma_k^{\\mathbf P}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\le_m^{\\mathbf P}\">\\(\\le_m^{\\mathbf P}\\)</span> 见本目录定义；矩阵允许一般布尔公式。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{QSAT}_k\\in\\Sigma_k^{\\mathbf P}\\land\n\\forall L\\in\\Sigma_k^{\\mathbf P}\\;L\\le_m^{\\mathbf P}\\mathrm{QSAT}_k.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{QSAT}_k\\in\\Sigma_k^{\\mathbf P}\\land\n\\forall L\\in\\Sigma_k^{\\mathbf P}\\;L\\le_m^{\\mathbf P}\\mathrm{QSAT}_k.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>成员资格按输入中的固定至多 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span> 块量词猜测/全称选值并多项式时间求矩阵。难性从第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span> 层多项式时间谓词构造电路计算，再将门变量的等式约束编为公式：若最后一块存在，则把门变量加入该块并要求门约束且输出为真；若最后一块全称，则把门变量加入该块并用“门约束蕴含输出真”。确定电路对每个输入恰有一组合法门值，两种版本均与原谓词等价，且不新增交替块。旧稿“Cook–Levin直接保留块数”的说法缺少这个末量词分支。</p>\n<p>来源核对：例5.6、习题5.1；印刷99、104页；PDF125、130页。原书完整性陈述已核对；末量词分支是本地补充的证明细节。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-qbf-k","status":"resolved","id":"91bfe52ee99ebd32","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-qbf-k]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-sigma-k-p","status":"resolved","id":"e4f9f10bc85fd486","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-sigma-k-p]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-poly-reduction","status":"resolved","id":"14088421136f8182","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-poly-reduction]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"k\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{QSAT}_k","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_k^{\\mathbf P}","display":false},{"tex":"\\le_m^{\\mathbf P}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{QSAT}_k\\in\\Sigma_k^{\\mathbf P}\\land\n\\forall L\\in\\Sigma_k^{\\mathbf P}\\;L\\le_m^{\\mathbf P}\\mathrm{QSAT}_k.","display":true},{"tex":"k","display":false},{"tex":"k","display":false}],"bytes":1469,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-83","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"多项式层级：[[28-df-sigma-k-p]]、[[28-df-pi-k-p]]、[[28-df-delta-k-p]]、[[28-df-ph]]、[[28-df-qbf-k]]、[[28-thm-qbf-k-complete]]。"},{"id":"60d18ddce61a8115","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["91bfe52ee99ebd32","e4f9f10bc85fd486","14088421136f8182"]}